  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports the expansion of Biovacs manufacturing facilities in South Africa. The facilities would have capability at its end state, to manufacture both Drug Substance and Drug Product and would be able to service the African Continent for a portion of its vaccine needs.</narrative>
